            "FloatArray → ByteArray → FloatArray must round-trip exactly",
            original,
            restored,
            0.0f
        )
    }

    @Test
    fun roundTripPreservesZeroAndSignedZero() {
        // Signed zero survives the byte round-trip: +0f and -0f
        // are distinct under `equals` but encode to the same
